            "review_title": "Review at An Hoi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "crystal c\n6 contributions\n0\nExperiencing Lunch on a Weekday\nJul 2025 • Friends\nWe waited for more than an hour to be seated at An Hoi Restaurant, but they kindly provided us with cold bottled water while we waited. The interior design is jungle theme and clean, with a comfortable atmosphere thanks to the air conditioning. Once seated, the service was decent and the food came in generous portions. Despite the long wait, the prices were surprisingly cheap considering the amount and quality of food served. It’s a good spot if you’re not in a rush and want a budget-friendly meal in a nice setting. Just be prepared to wait during peak hours.\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2025",
